 "remarks": "Dynamic extra large 2 Bedroom 2.5 Bath corner unit facing North & East. Elegant open living space with a wall of floor-to-ceiling windows for abundant sunlight & views of the vibrant city. Custom painted thru-out with beautiful new flooring, Features a den/office space, private terrace. Gourmet chef's kitchen boasts white Carrara Marble, GE Cafe stainless appliances, huge center island, wine cooler. Gorgeous hardwood flooring, spa-like marble master bath w/soaking tub, walk-in closets. Amenities including secure valet parking, full-time doorman, porter & concierge, state of the art fitness center, all season lap pool, wrap around terrace, saunas, play center, screening & billiards rooms, party room w/catering kitchen. Stunning primary suite w/ custom baths & closets. Experience the many amenities not found elsewhere; fitness center, indoor swimming pool, lounge, party room, billiards room, locker rooms with saunas, screening/media room and 36th floor rooftop terrace. 24 hour concierge service, Available shuttle ride to and from transportation center. Storage UNIT Included",
